From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: The Playport authors <dev@playport.dev>
Date: Thu, 24 Sep 2026 15:15:45 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] winemetal: regenerate the dispatch guards and census names
 after the upstream rebase

The rebase onto 3Shain/dxmt main put upstream's unix calls at slots 127-145
and Madeira's appended calls after them (madeira_ir_convert 146,
newRenderPipelineStateVD 147, newGeometryEmulationPipelineState 148,
madeira_ctl 149). gen_remote_guard.py and gen_api_names.py own the table's
guard names and the census name list, so both are rerun here. Upstream's
residency-set and heap calls carry Madeira's remote handling in their bodies
and join the routed set.

Class: madeira-port
Evidence: docs/evidence/2026-09-24-dxmt-latest-rebase.md
Offered-upstream: no
---
 src/winemetal/gen_remote_guard.py     |  6 +-
 src/winemetal/unix/winemetal_unix.c   | 44 ++++++-------
 src/winemetal/unix/wmt_remote_guard.h | 91 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 src/winemetal/wmt_api_names.h         | 29 ++++++---
 4 files changed, 138 insertions(+), 32 deletions(-)

diff --git a/src/winemetal/gen_remote_guard.py b/src/winemetal/gen_remote_guard.py
index ae367b4..49f60aa 100644
--- a/src/winemetal/gen_remote_guard.py
+++ b/src/winemetal/gen_remote_guard.py
@@ -79,8 +79,12 @@ ROUTED = {
     '_MTLCommandEncoder_setLabel',
     '_MTLDevice_newRenderPipelineStateVD',
     '_MTLDevice_newSharedTexture',
-    '_MTLDevice_newResidencySet', '_MTLResidencySet_addAllocation',
+    # residency sets and heaps: upstream DXMT's calls, with Madeira's remote
+    # handling folded into their bodies (routed, or a clean 0 / no-op)
+    '_MTLDevice_newResidencySet', '_MTLResidencySet_addAllocations',
+    '_MTLResidencySet_removeAllocations',
     '_MTLResidencySet_commit', '_MTLCommandQueue_addResidencySet',
+    '_MTLDevice_newHeap', '_MTLDevice_heapTextureSizeAndAlign', '_MTLHeap_newTexture',
     '_MTLDevice_newGeometryEmulationPipelineState',
 }
 
